{
    "title": "Gallery: Photo Gallery, Album",
    "description": "<b>Gallery - HD Photo Gallery & Album is a pro-HD gallery app for Android with a photo slideshow, photos manager, gallery vault (hide photos & videos), AI photo editor, and HD video player tools.</b> Our HD Photo Gallery App helps you to slideshow, view, organize, and edit photos, videos, GIFs, and albums and lock pictures in the photo vault. \ud83d\udd25\r\n\r\n<b>This HD Gallery - Photo Gallery & Album has an advanced photo slideshow for all formats for slideshowing photos & videos hassle-free.</b> You can easily hide photos and videos with a photo vault that only you can access. You can easily enter your PIN and view your pictures in the private album. \ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f\ud83d\udd25\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc47 <b>Key Features of Gallery - Photo Gallery App for Android</b>\r\n\u2022 Set custom photo albums to easily recognize specific GIFs,  Photos, albums & Videos\r\n\u2022 Photos Slideshow app automatically organizes your photos in an album\r\n\u2022 Resize and mirror pictures with a single click in our HD Photo Gallery App\r\n\u2022 Automatically duplicate picture finder tool to save space in the device\r\n\r\n<b>Pic Search Made Easy</b>\r\nPicture search is made easy with location and color-based picture search in HD Gallery - Photo Gallery App. Easily browse your photos with a color-based picture filter.\r\n\r\n<b>Story Status</b>\r\n\u21d2 Relive your cherished memories with the Story Status feature of our HD Photo Album app. Perfectly remember by viewing photos, GIFs, and videos from 1 month ago, 1 year ago\r\n\r\n<b>Perfect AI Photo Editor</b>\r\n\u2022 AI Photo Editor blurs, removes, or changes the backgrounds of your pictures with a single click \r\n\u2022Adjust the brightness, contrast, warmth saturation, etc; of your photos with ease\r\n\u2022 Add text on the photos with various fancy fonts\r\n\r\n<b>Gallery - Photo Vault</b>\r\n\u21d2 Now you can easily protect important photos & videos in a private album. Set a password, pattern, or PIN for viewing encrypted photos & videos in the picture manager to keep your private picture albums safe.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcfd <b>Photo Slideshow</b>\r\n\u21d2 You can easily View photos, GIFs, and collages in your slideshow. Use the photo slideshow feature, such as changing slide timing, and viewing backward, including photos, GIFs, and more.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfad <b>Duplicate Removal</b>\r\n\u21d2 The pic album app's pictures manager makes it easy to find and remove duplicate pictures and videos. It uses AI technology to find duplicate photos & videos from albums.\r\n\r\n<b>We Delete your photos & videos after 30 days so that you can manage your trash more smoothly.</b>  You can easily recover deleted media from the trash using the album app.\r\n\r\nOur Photo Manager allows you to share any photos to various social media platforms and it supports viewing media in all formats like <b>PNG, JPEG, GIF, SVG, Panoramic, MKV, MP4, RAW,</b> etc.\r\n\r\nOur App is also compatible with all Android devices like <b>Miui, MI (Xiaomi), Samsung Galaxy, Motorola</b>, etc.\r\n\r\n\u27a1\ufe0f We enhance your experience of viewing album photos & videos by simply taking permission to access media & cameras.\r\n\r\nWe are always there when you have any queries related to our secure Photo Manager app just contact the support email.\r\n\r\n<b>Explore, organize, and cherish your picture memory like never before with photo slideshow, Download our HD Gallery - Photo Gallery for Android now to take your photo viewing experience to the next level</b>",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Gallery - HD Photo Gallery &amp; Album is a pro-HD gallery app for Android with a photo slideshow, photos manager, gallery vault (hide photos &amp; videos), AI photo editor, and HD video player tools.</b> Our HD Photo Gallery App helps you to slideshow, view, organize, and edit photos, videos, GIFs, and albums and lock pictures in the photo vault. \ud83d\udd25<br><br><b>This HD Gallery - Photo Gallery &amp; Album has an advanced photo slideshow for all formats for slideshowing photos &amp; videos hassle-free.</b> You can easily hide photos and videos with a photo vault that only you can access. You can easily enter your PIN and view your pictures in the private album. \ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f\ud83d\udd25<br><br>\ud83d\udc47 <b>Key Features of Gallery - Photo Gallery App for Android</b><br>\u2022 Set custom photo albums to easily recognize specific GIFs,  Photos, albums &amp; Videos<br>\u2022 Photos Slideshow app automatically organizes your photos in an album<br>\u2022 Resize and mirror pictures with a single click in our HD Photo Gallery App<br>\u2022 Automatically duplicate picture finder tool to save space in the device<br><br><b>Pic Search Made Easy</b><br>Picture search is made easy with location and color-based picture search in HD Gallery - Photo Gallery App. Easily browse your photos with a color-based picture filter.<br><br><b>Story Status</b><br>\u21d2 Relive your cherished memories with the Story Status feature of our HD Photo Album app. Perfectly remember by viewing photos, GIFs, and videos from 1 month ago, 1 year ago<br><br><b>Perfect AI Photo Editor</b><br>\u2022 AI Photo Editor blurs, removes, or changes the backgrounds of your pictures with a single click <br>\u2022Adjust the brightness, contrast, warmth saturation, etc; of your photos with ease<br>\u2022 Add text on the photos with various fancy fonts<br><br><b>Gallery - Photo Vault</b><br>\u21d2 Now you can easily protect important photos &amp; videos in a private album. Set a password, pattern, or PIN for viewing encrypted photos &amp; videos in the picture manager to keep your private picture albums safe.<br><br>\ud83d\udcfd <b>Photo Slideshow</b><br>\u21d2 You can easily View photos, GIFs, and collages in your slideshow. Use the photo slideshow feature, such as changing slide timing, and viewing backward, including photos, GIFs, and more.<br><br>\ud83c\udfad <b>Duplicate Removal</b><br>\u21d2 The pic album app&#39;s pictures manager makes it easy to find and remove duplicate pictures and videos. It uses AI technology to find duplicate photos &amp; videos from albums.<br><br><b>We Delete your photos &amp; videos after 30 days so that you can manage your trash more smoothly.</b>  You can easily recover deleted media from the trash using the album app.<br><br>Our Photo Manager allows you to share any photos to various social media platforms and it supports viewing media in all formats like <b>PNG, JPEG, GIF, SVG, Panoramic, MKV, MP4, RAW,</b> etc.<br><br>Our App is also compatible with all Android devices like <b>Miui, MI (Xiaomi), Samsung Galaxy, Motorola</b>, etc.<br><br>\u27a1\ufe0f We enhance your experience of viewing album photos &amp; videos by simply taking permission to access media &amp; cameras.<br><br>We are always there when you have any queries related to our secure Photo Manager app just contact the support email.<br><br><b>Explore, organize, and cherish your picture memory like never before with photo slideshow, Download our HD Gallery - Photo Gallery for Android now to take your photo viewing experience to the next level</b>",
